        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Ave, dulcis Mater Christi, Quae prae regis furia Sevente, corde tristi, Fugis exul patria.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            395
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prime-b0006",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Pro Regina beatorum, Nostri spes exilii, Fac, infractus vel malorum Fiam consors Filii.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            395
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prime-b0007",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Ant. Vide, Domine, quoniam tribulor, conturbatus est venter meus; subversus est cor meum in moerentia, quoniam amaritudine plena sum: foris interfecit gladius, et domi mors similis est. (Thren. 2.)",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            395
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prime-b0008",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Domine, ante te omne desiderium meum.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            395
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prime-b0009",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. Et gemitus meus a te non est absconditus.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            395
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prime-b0010",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Oremus, Interveniat pro nobis, etc. ut supra.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            395
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prime-b0011",
          "verification": "pending"
        }
